tips.CASE:
Branch on a value:

```pascal
case n of
  1: writeln('one');
  2: writeln('two');
else writeln('other');
end;
```

tips.FUNCTION:
Subroutine returning a value:

```pascal
function Double(n: integer): integer;
begin
    Double := n * 2;
end;
```

tips.PROCEDURE:
Subroutine with no return value:

```pascal
procedure Greet;
begin
    writeln('Hello');
end;
```
